    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your epic space adventure awaits you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the infinite expanse of the universe with Astrosphere, a captivating sci-fi adventure that blends exploration, strategy, and action-packed combat. As the commander of your own customizable space station, you're ready to explore unknown galaxies and uncover their secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design Your Space Station:</strong> Build and expand your station into a powerful hub of interstellar activity. Upgrade modules, research new technologies, and tailor it to your needs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Shipbuilding:</strong> Design and personalize unique spaceships. Equip them with a wide array of weapons and systems to tackle any challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Exploration:</strong> Journey through procedurally generated star systems, discover mysterious planets, and experience unexpected events that make every adventure unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thrilling Combat:</strong> Face off against dangerous pirates, mysterious anomalies, and other threats. Employ tactical strategies in intense top-down battles to survive in space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Progression System:</strong> Gather resources, unlock upgrades, and forge your own path through the universe. Every decision shapes your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Presentation:</strong> Enjoy stunning visuals and an immersive soundtrack that draws you deep into the world of Astrosphere.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to explore the unknown and leave your mark on the universe?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your ultimate space adventure with <strong>Astrosphere</strong> now!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your epic space adventure awaits you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the infinite expanse of the universe with Astrosphere, a captivating sci-fi adventure that blends exploration, strategy, and action-packed combat. As the commander of your own customizable space station, you're ready to explore unknown galaxies and uncover their secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design Your Space Station:</strong> Build and expand your station into a powerful hub of interstellar activity. Upgrade modules, research new technologies, and tailor it to your needs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Shipbuilding:</strong> Design and personalize unique spaceships. Equip them with a wide array of weapons and systems to tackle any challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Exploration:</strong> Journey through procedurally generated star systems, discover mysterious planets, and experience unexpected events that make every adventure unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thrilling Combat:</strong> Face off against dangerous pirates, mysterious anomalies, and other threats. Employ tactical strategies in intense top-down battles to survive in space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Progression System:</strong> Gather resources, unlock upgrades, and forge your own path through the universe. Every decision shapes your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Presentation:</strong> Enjoy stunning visuals and an immersive soundtrack that draws you deep into the world of Astrosphere.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to explore the unknown and leave your mark on the universe?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your ultimate space adventure with <strong>Astrosphere</strong> now!</p>",
